   "id": "e50",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1776,
   "y": 962.5,
   "width": 240.24,
   "height": 130.0,
   "text": "Holds the span in memory, then:\n\n1. finds the agent turn whose\n   time window contains it\n2. reads that trace's spans and\n   picks the matching tool.* span\n3. re-emits the span with the\n   AGENT's trace id + that parent",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Holds the span in memory, then:\n\n1. finds the agent turn whose\n   time window contains it\n2. reads that trace's spans and\n   picks the matching tool.* span\n3. re-emits the span with the\n   AGENT's trace id + that parent",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
