  {
   "angle": 0,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 420707,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5552637,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "id": "e53",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2336,
   "y": 917.5,
   "width": 444.08000000000004,
   "height": 178.75,
   "text": "A trace id here IS the OTel trace id \u2014 which is why a span\nsent with the agent's trace id lands inside that trace.\n\n   agent\n     llm.qwen3-\u2026\n       tool.mcp_gateway_telemetry_get_reservoir_level\n         gateway verified: get_reservoir_level   <- WHO\n       tool.mcp_gateway_control_stop_pump\n         gateway verified: stop_pump\n\nOne trace per turn. No loose gateway traces are ever created.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "A trace id here IS the OTel trace id \u2014 which is why a span\nsent with the agent's trace id lands inside that trace.\n\n   agent\n     llm.qwen3-\u2026\n       tool.mcp_gateway_telemetry_get_reservoir_level\n         gateway verified: get_reservoir_level   <- WHO\n       tool.mcp_gateway_control_stop_pump\n         gateway verified: stop_pump\n\nOne trace per turn. No loose gateway traces are ever created.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
